  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Remove \"outfile\" pragma from flex files",
  "description": "Using this pragma is unnecessary and undesirable for the following\nreasons:\n\n1) It is surprising and unusual that a pragma inside the file overrides\nthe command-line options, usually command-line options take precedence\nover hard-coded values, but not for flex.\n\n2) Not all flex files in the tree use this \"outfile\" option pragma so\nits use is inconsistent.\n\n3) More importantly this ignores the command-line --output flag and forces\nthe output to be created on the current working directory with the specified\nname. The fact that it works correctly at all with CMake in completely\nincidental to an implementation detail, because CMake changes the working\ndirectory to the correct output build directory. This is not a universal\nequirement and may cause bizarre and difficult to troubleshoot failures\nin different circumstances.\n\nReplace \"-o\" with \"--outfile\" in the cmake file for better readability.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2024-10-29T00:35:23.581Z",
